 real  credit card on me i can use a virtual  card on my privacy mobile app but really  the best part is  you're not out there exposing your real  credit card number so you're not as  susceptible to data breaches and  identity theft privacy is a totally free  service and you'll get five bucks to  spend when you go to privacy.com  pacman the link is right underneath this  video

